Subject: fix(compose): clear native semantics of removed nodes

Semantics nodes that leave the tree kept their native accessibility label,
role and actions on the reused native view. Track the KNodes that received
semantics and reset label/role/info when they disappear; on node detach drop
only that node's cache entry instead of clearing the whole cache.

Fork-Patch: compose-clear-removed-native-semantics
Origin: 3951e170
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

